==English==

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|head=[[new|New]] [[year|Year]][['s]] [[eve|Eve]]}}

# The [[holiday]] occurring on the last day of the year, [[December]] 31st.

====Related terms====
* [[New Year's Day]]
* [[watch night]] {{qualifier|not identical to ''New Year's Eve''&nbsp;– New Year's Eve is the entire day before New Year's Day, whereas watch night is the night that begins at sundown on New Year's Eve and ends with sunrise on New Year's Day}}

